flowchart TD
    subgraph Client_Level ["Client Exception Detection"]
        ClientReq["Client Submits Form / Action"]
        TokenExpired["Token Expired / Missing"]
        RoleBlocked["Unauthorized / Low Grant Level"]
        ZodInvalid["Form Validation Fails"]
    end

    subgraph Wire_Level ["HTTP Status & Problem Details (RFC 7807)"]
        HTTP401["HTTP 401 Unauthorized -> Clear Session & Redirect to /login"]
        HTTP403["HTTP 403 Forbidden -> Display Permission Denied Toast"]
        HTTP404["HTTP 404 Site Not Found -> Validate X-Site-Id Header"]
        HTTP412["HTTP 412 Precondition Failed -> Concurrency Conflict Alert"]
        HTTP422["HTTP 422 Validation Failed -> Inline Field Errors"]
        HTTP409["HTTP 409 Conflict -> Record Already Exists / Duplicate"]
        HTTP500["HTTP 500 Database Error -> Log Stack & Alert Admin"]
    end

    subgraph Database_Recovery ["Server & Database State Recovery"]
        Rollback["Prisma Transaction Rollback ($transaction)"]
        CacheHit["Idempotency Cache Replay (X-Cache-Lookup: HIT)"]
        OptimisticReload["Client TanStack Cache Invalidation & Silent Refetch"]
        FallbackStore["Switch to In-Memory Dev Store (isDbLive == false)"]
    end

    ClientReq --> ZodInvalid
    ZodInvalid --> HTTP422
    ClientReq --> TokenExpired
    TokenExpired --> HTTP401
    ClientReq --> RoleBlocked
    RoleBlocked --> HTTP403

    ClientReq -->|If-Match mismatch| HTTP412
    HTTP412 --> OptimisticReload

    ClientReq -->|Duplicate key| HTTP409
    HTTP409 --> CacheHit

    ClientReq -->|Invalid siteId| HTTP404

    ClientReq -->|DB Constraint Violation| HTTP500
    HTTP500 --> Rollback
    HTTP500 --> FallbackStore

